### =========================
### TRAFFIC FINE CONTROL
### =========================

### TrafficFineControl - GetAll (paginacao + busca)
GET {{ControlVehicle.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/TrafficFineControl?page=1&size=5&search=radar
Accept: application/json

###
### TrafficFineControl - GetById
GET {{ControlVehicle.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/TrafficFineControl/{{trafficFineControlId}}
Accept: application/json

###
### TrafficFineControl - Create
POST {{ControlVehicle.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/TrafficFineControl
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": "{{vehicleId}}",
  "driverId": "{{driverId}}",
  "points": 5,
  "value": 293.47,
  "date": "2026-03-14T11:20:00Z",
  "description": "Excesso de velocidade em via urbana."
}

###
### TrafficFineControl - Update
PUT {{ControlVehicle.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/TrafficFineControl/{{trafficFineControlId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: application/json

{
  "id": "{{trafficFineControlId}}",
  "vehicleId": "{{vehicleId}}",
  "driverId": "{{driverId}}",
  "points": 7,
  "value": 880.41,
  "date": "2026-03-17T16:10:00Z",
  "description": "Multa gravissima atualizada."
}

###
### TrafficFineControl - Delete
